---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | padhDSA Visual Algorithm Learning Platform"
  description="padhDSA Privacy Policy: Transparent data practices, client-side browser storage, and zero tracking cookies."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 py-6 sm:py-10">
    
    {/* Page Header */}
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-textSecondary/20 pb-6 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-focusBg border border-focusBorder text-focusText text-xs font-mono font-extrabold px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>LEGAL TRANSPARENCY</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-main tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-textSecondary font-bold">Effective Date: January 1, 2026 • Last Updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>

    {/* Content Card */}
    <div class="bg-card/90 backdrop-blur-xl border border-textSecondary/20 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-md space-y-6 text-textSecondary text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-medium">
      
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-main flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>💾 1. Client-Side Browser Storage</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          padhDSA prioritizes learner privacy. Your progress, chosen name, language preferences, and hobby selections are saved exclusively within your browser's local sandbox (<code>localStorage</code>). We do not transmit or store your profile data on remote databases.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-main flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🚫 2. Zero Tracking & Ad-Free</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          We do not deploy third-party advertising trackers, profiling cookies, or data-monetization analytics. Your learning experience remains 100% ad-free and private.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-main flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🛡️ 3. Full Data Control</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          Because your preferences are stored locally, you maintain complete control. Clearing your browser cache or site storage resets your profile data instantly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-textSecondary/15 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <p class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-textSecondary">Have privacy questions?</p>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-focusBg border border-focusBorder text-focusText text-xs font-mono font-extrabold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        >
          <span>Contact Privacy Desk ✉️</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
